WEBVTT

00:39:29.437 --> 00:39:32.071
And a large percentage
of the population is losing that.

00:39:32.095 --> 00:39:33.953
So that has to be engineered well,

00:39:33.977 --> 00:39:36.175
so that they are productive,

00:39:36.199 --> 00:39:38.596
as well as divide the pie well,

00:39:38.620 --> 00:39:42.040
and everybody believes
that the system is fair.

00:39:42.064 --> 00:39:43.399
We can get there.

00:39:43.778 --> 00:39:46.164
Am I optimistic that we will get there?

00:39:46.188 --> 00:39:47.347
You know, I don't know.

00:39:47.371 --> 00:39:49.878
I would say, I'm 60-40 pessimistic

00:39:49.902 --> 00:39:52.862
that we'll be good enough
with each other to do that.

00:39:52.886 --> 00:39:54.839
But there's that possibility.

00:39:54.863 --> 00:39:56.124
This is our test.

00:39:56.434 --> 00:39:58.034
This is our stress test.